    60	This includes:
    61	    - The `1_run_queries.py` script.
    62	    - The `IKGs` directory, containing IKGs. More specifically:
    63	        - The `test_outputs` directory includes test IKGs constructed to facilitate artifact evaluation process.
    64	        - The `empirical` directory includes the IKGs constructed for the subject projects in this study in `.zip` format to facilitate the reproduction of the ASE 2024 study.
    65	
    66	- The `4_Empirical_Analysis` directory contains the script and data to reproduce the results presented in the paper (subject project statistics, **RQ1** results and manual analysis, **RQ2** results).
    67	This includes:
    68	    - The `1_compute_empirical_results.py` script that processes the query results and produces the tables, figures, and other experimental results presented in the paper.
    69	    - The `empirical_results` which contains the file `selected_project_intermediate_meta_data.csv`, i.e., a copy of the output of the data set curation process.
    70	    - The `query_results` directory includes the results of querying the 10,000 build commits analyzed in this study.
    71	    - The `RQ1_Manual_Inspections.xlsx` file, containing our labelled data for the manual inspection that we performed to address **RQ1**.
