    90	        - No colour: Since the 10 subject projects were selected, the remaining projects in the ranked list were not tested.
    91	    - The `IKGs/empirical` directory includes the IKGs constructed for the subject projects in this study in `.zip` format to facilitate the reproduction of the study.
